{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56934","headline":"教坊伶人献语 · 佚名","name":"教坊伶人献语","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天子不须忧北寇，守贞面上管幽州。\n（见《旧五代史》卷一○九《李守贞传》）（〖1〗《旧五代史》云：「其年〖指开运二年〗夏，契丹寇边，以守贞爲北面行营都部署。\n少主开曲宴於内殿，以宠其行，教坊伶人献语云〖略〗。\n既罢，守贞有自负之色。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56934.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56934","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}